.SH NAME
gf-signed-in-user-update-signed-in-user - Updates signed in user


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf signed-in-user update-signed-in-user [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Updates signed in user

.PP
Body schema (UpdateUserCommand):
  email  string
  login  string
  name   string
  theme  string

.PP
Response schema (UpdateSignedInUserOK.Payload):
  message  string


